{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10271200","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10271200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1027120001:0":{"text":"다행이다, 리프! 다치지 않았구나!","source_cn":"太好了，一叶！你没受伤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8F23D8D2D10A48F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1027120002:1":{"text":"!!","source_cn":"！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76F44BEC7C4E5784","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027120003:0":{"text":"무사하니 다행이야. 이제 더 이상 나를 놀라게 하지 마...","source_cn":"只要你没事就好，别再乱跑吓我了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DAD5E84A8E42955","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027120004:0":{"text":"...! ","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027120005:0":{"text":"...리프? 어... 어딜 가려고?!","source_cn":"……一叶？你……你要去哪？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE8BFE12404D93DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027120006:0":{"text":"잠깐만... 저 두 마리는 조금 전에 다미안을 습격한 빛나는 꽃이에요!!","source_cn":"