cument_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027120011:0":{"text":"...생각한 것보다 훨씬 빨리 왔네요.","source_cn":"……来得好快啊，比我想象的还快呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9B9C8663454D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1027120011":{"text":"...생각한 것보다 훨씬 빨리 왔네요.","source_cn":"……来得好快啊，比我想象的还快呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A9B9C8663454D4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1027120012:0":{"text":"난 슬프지 않아요... 대신 기뻐해주는 거예요...","source_cn":"我、我没有伤心，我在替它高兴……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47ED5A0217E197CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1027120013:0":{"text":"...? ","source_cn":"……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C15B5912CAA4C17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1027120014:0":{"text":"그렇게 쳐다보지 마... 널 위해 기뻐해야지. 그렇지? 네가 드디어 가족들과 만나게 되었으니까...","source_cn":"你别这样看着我啦……我应该替你高兴的，对不对？你终于能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944114E8D3C94660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1027120015:0":{"text":"!!\n...! ","source_cn":"！！\\n……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96CC886AF85E3A52","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1027120016:0":{"text":"음... 리프는 뭐라고 하고 싶은 걸까?","source_cn":"呃……一叶是想表达什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x204995F7E8B89925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1027120017:0":{"text":"...! \n!!!","source_cn":"……！\\n！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC18E13D49F77993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1027120018:0":{"text":"...풉. 리프, 그렇게 위로해주지 않아도 돼...","source_cn":"……噗。一叶，你不用这样安慰我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE25DB76315D4A63C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1027120019:0":{"text":"리프... 어서 집으로 돌아가.","source_cn":"你……你跟着它们回去吧。回家去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC881EA45E9C7A774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:30:1027120019":{"text":"리프... 어서 집으로 돌아가.","source_cn":"你……你跟着它们回去吧。回家去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC881EA45E9C7A774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1027120020:0":{"text":"당연히 섭섭하죠... 하지만 리프가 돌아가는 것이야말로 올바른 선택이니까요.","source_cn":"当然舍不得……但是，让一叶回去才是最好的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DE7915DE391312C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1027120023:0":{"text":"리프에게는 가족이 있고, 돌아가서 사랑받는 게... 더 좋을 거예요!","source_cn":"它有自己的族群，有同伴爱护它、关心它……这很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAE60F777CBD907E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1027120024:0":{"text":"저는... 리프가 가족을 떠나지 않았으면 좋겠어요. 가족이 없는 기분을 잘 아니까요...","source_cn":"我……我不想要它离开家人。没有家人的感觉，我最清楚了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AF086C6C53C3A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:30:0:1":{"text":"섭섭하지 않아?","source_cn":"你舍得吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8642022321F8AB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"섭섭하지 않아?","female":"섭섭하지 않아?","variant_male_record_index":"60742","variant_female_record_index":"60743","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1027120021:0":{"text":"아니요. 지금 리프를 돌려보내 주지 않으면 그때야말로 정말 후회하게 될 것 같아요.","source_cn":"才不会呢。如果现在不让一叶回归族群，以后才是真的会后悔。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FE213E4A2649B26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record